          marks: 2,
          prompt: 'Define an alien (invasive) species.',
          answer: 'An alien (invasive) species is a species introduced, whether deliberately or accidentally, into an area outside its natural (native) range, where it can spread rapidly and cause harm to the local ecosystem.',
