          prompt: 'A population of 800 springbok experiences 96 births, 40 deaths, 20 individuals immigrating into the population, and 12 individuals emigrating out of the population over one year. Calculate (a) the net change in population size, and (b) the population growth rate as a percentage, over that year.',
