          explanation: 'This is precisely why stopping antibiotics early, even when feeling better, is discouraged: it can inadvertently apply strong selective pressure favouring the survival and subsequent spread of more resistant bacteria, directly contributing to the wider public health problem of antibiotic resistance.',
